&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;Do you thrive in a fast-paced environment, where you gain a tremendous amount of responsibility? Do you want to be part of an exceptional entrepreneurial team with young, motivated and extremely driven people? And are you curious or passionate about people? If so, you might be our next Graduate Social Media Manager.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
