&lt;div&gt;Set up experiments for testing new robotics software functionalities&amp;nbsp;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;div&gt;Run simulations in HiL/SiL environments for validation of new control approaches &amp;nbsp;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;div&gt;Assist with debugging and troubleshooting within the existing robotics software stack &amp;nbsp;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;div&gt;Collect data from robot experiments and organize test results &amp;nbsp;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;div&gt;Analyze experimental data and summarize findings &amp;nbsp;&lt;/div&gt;
