&lt;div class=&quot;TranslationField-module__fieldItem___g4pRX&quot;&gt;
&lt;div&gt;The &lt;strong&gt;Industrial Application Group of Agile Robots&lt;/strong&gt; is looking for a motivated &lt;strong&gt;Intern (m/f/d) Vision Software Development&lt;/strong&gt; to support the development, testing, and commissioning of industrial vision systems for robotic and AGV applications. In this full-time internship, you will work hands-on across the entire lifecycle of our vision solutions — from software development and camera calibration at our Munich headquarters to on-site commissioning at customer production sites.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;TranslationField-module__fieldItem___g4pRX&quot;&gt;
&lt;h3 class=&quot;TokenisedTypography-module__EzGiEkH0__v6-3-8 TranslationField-module__fieldItemName___Q0F_7&quot;&gt;Your Responsibilities&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Vision Software Development:&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;Develop, test, and&amp;nbsp;maintain&amp;nbsp;software components for industrial 2D/3D vision systems, including API-based secondary development on top of vision vendor SDKs.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Camera Setup &amp;amp; Calibration:&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;Configure and calibrate 2D area-scan/line-scan cameras and 3D sensors for robotic and AGV applications, performing nine-point, checkerboard, and 3D hand-eye calibrations.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Algorithm Debugging:&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;Support the debugging and tuning of core vision algorithms, from QR-code and natural-contour (V-SLAM) AGV navigation to deep-learning-based detection models.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Testing &amp;amp; Automation:&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;Write Python scripts for automated testing and data-log&amp;nbsp;analysis, and&amp;nbsp;validate vision system performance in the lab and in production-like environments.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;System Integration:&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;Configure and troubleshoot data exchange between vision industrial PCs (IPCs) and PLCs, supporting communication via TCP/IP sockets, Modbus TCP, and ROS/ROS2.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;On-Site Commissioning:&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;Travel to customer sites to install, commission, fine-tune, and troubleshoot vision systems on real production lines.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Cross-Team Collaboration:&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;Work closely with robotics, software, and application engineers to integrate vision solutions into end-to-end robotic systems.&lt;/li&gt;
